Easy Magic for Sunrise 26.3 (version 0.5.0)

A port of Easy Magic by Fuzs (8.0.1 / 26.3.1).
Original source: https://github.com/Fuzss/easymagic
Original licence: MPL-2.0

Ported to Sunrise by lavoide and arismoko: the rules are re-implemented in Rust on Sunrise's typed mod API (no Java code is included). This port is distributed under the same licence as the original (MPL-2.0); the licence text is in LICENSE.

LICENSE is the original project's MPL-2.0 licence. None of the original project's All-Rights-Reserved image assets are included: the icon and reroll button graphics are original work for this port.
